#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running the Aer simulator shows the results: Alice and Bob's classical bits always agree.\n"
msgstr "Menjalankan simulator Aer menunjukkan hasilnya: bit klasik Alice dan Bob selalu sama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
